### Vendored monorepo build artifacts (crates/ + packages/) ###
# Rust build artifacts
target/

# packages/ Bun workspace (workspace root, node-modules layout).
# Scoped to packages/ so the rest of the dotfiles repo is unaffected. The
# single workspace-root packages/bun.lock is intentionally TRACKED (lockfile
# convention, like the Rust Cargo.lock); per-member dist/ build output is not.
packages/node_modules/
packages/*/node_modules/
packages/*/dist/
.turbo/
packages/.turbo/
packages/*/.turbo/

### codegraph ###
.codegraph

### claude ###
.claude

### agents ###
# dotagents auto-generates project state directly under .agents/; that stays
# untracked. Hand-authored repo-scoped skills in .agents/skills/ ARE tracked —
# see AGENTS.md "Repo-scoped agent tooling". Do not collapse this back to a
# bare `.agents`, which makes every descendant unreachable to a negation.
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/

### Compound Engineering ###
docs/plans/.*.md
.compound-engineering/*.local.yaml

# Auto-generated by dotagents — do not commit these files.
agents.lock
.agents/.gitignore

### Secrets cache — only the GPG-encrypted .asc is committable ###
# chezmoi-secrets-sync builds the bundle in memory and only ever writes .json.asc,
# but this guard makes a stray plaintext (or .tmp) variant impossible to commit.
.chezmoitemplates/secrets-bundle.json*
!.chezmoitemplates/secrets-bundle.json.asc
